window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A man and a woman who thrive on danger and deception find explosive passion in this compelling novel where nothing is as it seems - from #1 </b><b><i>New York Times</i></b><b> bestselling author Nora Roberts.</b></p> <p>The daughter of a world-renowned magician, Roxy Nouvelle has inherited her father’s talents - and his penchant for jewel thievery. Into this colorful world comes Luke Callahan, an escape artist who captures her heart - and keeps secrets that could shatter all her illusions...</p>"; 
